#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:1
msgid "Extensions"
msgstr "扩展"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:3
msgid "Extension discovery and snapshot contracts for optional plugins."
msgstr "可选插件的扩展发现与快照契约。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:5
msgid ""
"See the [usage guide](../conventions.md) for task-oriented examples. "
"Signatures below are generated from the public headers at the same commit as"
" the rest of this site."
msgstr "面向任务的示例参见[使用指南](../conventions.md)。以下签名由与本站点其余内容同一提交的公共头文件生成。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:7
msgid "A registered hook for one event."
msgstr "针对某一事件注册的钩子。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:7
msgid ""
"The event is trimmed when stored; the fingerprint is stored verbatim and "
"must be non-blank. The callback must be callable. Hooks with the same event "
"and priority are ordered by fingerprint inside extension_snapshot."
msgstr "事件名在存储时会被裁剪空白；指纹按原样存储且必须非空白。回调必须可调用。事件与优先级相同的钩子在 extension_snapshot 内按指纹排序。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:7 ../../site/api/extensions.md:10
#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:13 ../../site/api/extensions.md:16
#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:22
msgid "Public Functions"
msgstr "公共函数"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:7
msgid "Creates a hook."
msgstr "创建一个钩子。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md
msgid "Throws"
msgstr "抛出"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:7
msgid "Returns the normalized event name."
msgstr "返回规范化后的事件名。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:7 ../../site/api/extensions.md:13
msgid "Returns the fingerprint as supplied."
msgstr "按传入原样返回指纹。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:7
msgid "Returns the hook priority."
msgstr "返回钩子优先级。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:7 ../../site/api/extensions.md:13
msgid "Returns the provenance metadata."
msgstr "返回来源元数据。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:7
msgid "Returns the callback."
msgstr "返回回调。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:10
msgid "Immutable native snapshot of extension operations, hooks and renderers."
msgstr "扩展操作、钩子与渲染器的不可变原生快照。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:10
msgid ""
"Ordering matches the pinned Python snapshot: operations by operation_id, "
"hooks grouped by event then by (priority, fingerprint), renderers by name. "
"Hooks are intentionally not duplicate-rejected (the source allows repeated "
"registrations); operations and renderers are."
msgstr ""
"排序规则与固定版本的 Python 快照一致：操作按 operation_id，钩子先按事件分组再按 (priority, "
"fingerprint)，渲染器按名称。钩子有意不做重复拒绝（源实现允许重复注册）；操作和渲染器则会拒绝重复。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:10
msgid "Creates a snapshot, validates entries, orders them and computes the digest."
msgstr "创建快照、校验条目、排序并计算摘要。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:10
msgid ""
"Operation and capability ids must start with extension. and contain at least"
" two dots. Operations must have domain extensions and non-blank "
"implementation fingerprints and RNG policies; operation ids must be unique, "
"and semantic_mode and mode_approval must be supplied together. Hooks may "
"repeat. Renderer names must be unique. Hooks are ordered by event, then "
"priority and fingerprint; operations by operation_id; renderers by name. The"
" digest is the SHA-256 of to_json()."
msgstr ""
"操作与能力 id 必须以 extension. 开头且至少包含两个点。操作的 domain 必须为 "
"extensions，实现指纹与随机数策略必须非空白；操作 id 必须唯一，且 semantic_mode 与 mode_approval "
"必须同时提供。钩子可以重复。渲染器名称必须唯一。钩子按事件、优先级、指纹排序；操作按 operation_id 排序；渲染器按名称排序。摘要为 "
"to_json() 的 SHA-256。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:10
msgid "Returns the operations ordered by operation_id."
msgstr "返回按 operation_id 排序的操作。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:10
msgid "Returns the hooks ordered by event, then priority and fingerprint."
msgstr "返回按事件、优先级、指纹排序的钩子。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:10
msgid "Returns the renderers ordered by name."
msgstr "返回按名称排序的渲染器。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:10
msgid "Returns the lowercase hexadecimal SHA-256 digest of to_json()."
msgstr "返回 to_json() 的小写十六进制 SHA-256 摘要。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:10
msgid "Returns compact, key-sorted, ASCII-escaped JSON used to compute digest."
msgstr "返回用于计算摘要的紧凑、按键排序、ASCII 转义 JSON。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:10
msgid "Returns a new snapshot with one more operation."
msgstr "返回多加一个操作的新快照。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:10
msgid ""
"The receiver is unchanged. The operation is validated as in the constructor,"
" so a duplicate operation id is rejected."
msgstr "接收者保持不变。操作按构造函数相同的方式校验，因此重复的操作 id 会被拒绝。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:10
msgid "Returns a new snapshot with one more hook."
msgstr "返回多加一个钩子的新快照。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:10
msgid "The receiver is unchanged. Repeated hook registrations are allowed."
msgstr "接收者保持不变。允许重复注册钩子。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:10
msgid "Returns a new snapshot with one more renderer."
msgstr "返回多加一个渲染器的新快照。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:10
msgid "The receiver is unchanged. A duplicate renderer name is rejected."
msgstr "接收者保持不变。重复的渲染器名称会被拒绝。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:10
msgid "Returns the hooks registered for event."
msgstr "返回为 event 注册的钩子。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:10
msgid ""
"event is normalized before lookup. The returned hooks are in execution "
"order: ascending priority, then ascending fingerprint."
msgstr "查找前会先规范化 event。返回的钩子按执行顺序排列：优先级升序，其次指纹升序。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:10
msgid "Runs the priority-ordered hooks for event."
msgstr "按优先级顺序执行 event 的钩子。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:10
msgid ""
"When first is present the hooks transform it left-to-right and the final "
"value is returned; when it is absent the hooks are notifications and a "
"monostate value is returned."
msgstr "当 first 存在时，钩子从左到右依次变换它并返回最终值；当它不存在时，钩子只是通知，返回 monostate 值。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:10
msgid "Exceptions thrown by a callback propagate to the caller."
msgstr "回调抛出的异常会传播给调用方。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:10
msgid "Looks up a renderer by name."
msgstr "按名称查找渲染器。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:10
msgid "name is normalized before lookup; a blank or unknown name yields nullopt."
msgstr "查找前会先规范化 name；空白或未知名称返回 nullopt。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:13
msgid "A registered renderer callback."
msgstr "已注册的渲染器回调。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:13
msgid ""
"The name is trimmed when stored; the fingerprint is stored verbatim and must"
" be non-blank. Renderer names are unique within a snapshot."
msgstr "名称在存储时会被裁剪空白；指纹按原样存储且必须非空白。同一快照内渲染器名称必须唯一。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:13
msgid "Creates a renderer registration."
msgstr "创建一条渲染器注册。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:13
msgid "Returns the normalized renderer name."
msgstr "返回规范化后的渲染器名称。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:13
msgid "Returns the renderer callback."
msgstr "返回渲染器回调。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:16
msgid "One unexecuted native extension manifest."
msgstr "一份尚未执行的原生扩展清单。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:16
msgid ""
"Field names mirror DiscoveredExtension; value uses the native "
"component:symbol convention instead of a Python import path."
msgstr "字段名与 DiscoveredExtension 对应；value 使用原生的 component:symbol 约定，而不是 Python 导入路径。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:16
msgid "Returns the stable SHA-256 of to_json()."
msgstr "返回 to_json() 的稳定 SHA-256。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:16
msgid "Returns compact, key-sorted, ASCII-escaped JSON for the manifest fields."
msgstr "返回清单字段的紧凑、按键排序、ASCII 转义 JSON。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:16 ../../site/api/extensions.md:19
#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:22 ../../site/api/extensions.md:25
msgid "Public Members"
msgstr "公共成员"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:16
msgid "Extension name."
msgstr "扩展名称。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:16
msgid "Entry-point group label."
msgstr "入口点分组标签。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:16
msgid "Supplying distribution."
msgstr "提供该扩展的发行包。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:16
msgid "component:symbol target."
msgstr "component:symbol 目标。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:19
msgid "Payload passed to a hook callback."
msgstr "传给钩子回调的载荷。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:19
msgid "Current value; monostate for notifications."
msgstr "当前值；通知场景为 monostate。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:19
msgid "Named scalar arguments."
msgstr "命名的标量参数。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:22
msgid "Native extension operation descriptor."
msgstr "原生扩展操作描述符。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:22
msgid ""
"It mirrors the metadata subset of fincore.runtime.specs.OperationSpec that "
"contributes to ExtensionSnapshot.digest; the callable and schemas stay in "
"the runtime catalog rather than in this overlay descriptor."
msgstr ""
"它对应 fincore.runtime.specs.OperationSpec 中参与 ExtensionSnapshot.digest "
"的元数据子集；可调用对象与模式仍留在运行时目录中，而不是这个覆盖描述符里。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:22
msgid ""
"Returns compact, key-sorted, ASCII-escaped JSON for the fields that "
"participate in the snapshot digest."
msgstr "返回参与快照摘要的字段的紧凑、按键排序、ASCII 转义 JSON。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:22
msgid "Stable across processes and platforms."
msgstr "跨进程与跨平台稳定。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:22
msgid "extension."
msgstr "以 extension. 开头"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:22
msgid "-prefixed id with at least two dots."
msgstr "、至少包含两个点的 id。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:22
msgid "Capability id in the same namespace."
msgstr "同一命名空间下的能力 id。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:22
msgid "Domain; must be extensions."
msgstr "领域；必须为 extensions。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:22
msgid "Non-blank implementation fingerprint."
msgstr "非空白的实现指纹。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:22
msgid "Optional non-blank extra tag."
msgstr "可选的非空白额外标签。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:22
msgid "Whether the operation is deterministic."
msgstr "该操作是否为确定性操作。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:22
msgid "Non-blank RNG policy label."
msgstr "非空白的随机数策略标签。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:22
msgid "Optional semantic mode."
msgstr "可选的语义模式。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:22
msgid "Optional mode approval."
msgstr "可选的模式批准。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:22
msgid "Metadata; excluded from the digest JSON."
msgstr "元数据；不包含在摘要 JSON 中。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:25
msgid "Result of validating one discovered manifest."
msgstr "校验一份已发现清单的结果。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:25
msgid ""
"The native ABI does not import code or call dlopen; this record is the load "
"validation boundary."
msgstr "原生 ABI 不会导入代码或调用 dlopen；该记录即为加载校验边界。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:25
msgid "Normalized, validated manifest."
msgstr "已规范化并校验的清单。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:25
msgid "SHA-256 of the normalized manifest."
msgstr "规范化清单的 SHA-256。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:28
msgid "Discovers and deterministically orders manifests for the requested groups."
msgstr "发现请求分组的清单并确定性地排序。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:28
msgid ""
"Each manifest is normalized by trimming its four text fields. A blank "
"required field is rejected even when the manifest's group is not requested. "
"Manifests whose normalized group is not in groups are ignored. Results are "
"stably sorted by (group, name, distribution, value), so duplicates are "
"preserved in input order."
msgstr ""
"每份清单通过裁剪其四个文本字段来规范化。即使清单所属分组未被请求，空白的必填字段也会被拒绝。规范化后分组不在 groups 中的清单会被忽略。结果按 "
"(group, name, distribution, value) 稳定排序，因此重复项保持输入顺序。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:31
msgid "Discovers and orders manifests from a vector."
msgstr "从 vector 发现并排序清单。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:34
msgid "Returns the source entry-point group names used by default."
msgstr "返回默认使用的源实现入口点分组名称。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:37
msgid "Validates and normalizes one manifest for explicit loading."
msgstr "校验并规范化一份清单以供显式加载。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:37
msgid ""
"The value must use the component:symbol form with exactly one colon, non-"
"empty parts and no ASCII whitespace. The returned manifest is trimmed and "
"fingerprinted. No dynamic library is opened and no code is loaded."
msgstr ""
"value 必须采用 component:symbol 形式，恰好一个冒号、各部分非空且不含 ASCII "
"空白字符。返回的清单已裁剪空白并计算指纹。不会打开动态库，也不会加载任何代码。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:40
msgid "Trims ASCII whitespace around a registration name."
msgstr "裁剪注册名称两侧的 ASCII 空白。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:40
msgid ""
"Case is preserved, as in the pinned source where names are case-sensitive. "
"Returns an empty string when the input only contains whitespace."
msgstr "保留大小写，与固定版本源实现中名称区分大小写的行为一致。当输入仅包含空白时返回空字符串。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:43
msgid "Returns the builtin extension-domain operations."
msgstr "返回内置的扩展领域操作。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:43
msgid ""
"The pinned source returns an empty tuple: third parties register namespaced "
"operations through snapshots."
msgstr "固定版本的源实现返回空元组：第三方通过快照注册带命名空间的操作。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:46
msgid ""
"A hook either returns a replacement for the first argument or nullopt to "
"leave it unchanged."
msgstr "钩子要么返回用于替换第一个参数的值，要么返回 nullopt 以保持其不变。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:46
msgid ""
"Returning a value for a notification invocation is ignored, matching the "
"source execute_hooks contract."
msgstr "在通知式调用中返回值会被忽略，与源实现的 execute_hooks 契约一致。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:49
msgid "Named scalar arguments passed to every hook callback."
msgstr "传给每个钩子回调的命名标量参数。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:52
msgid "Native name for an input manifest supplied by a host application."
msgstr "宿主应用提供的输入清单的原生名称。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:55
msgid "Renderers are native callbacks that map a request key to a stable payload."
msgstr "渲染器是将请求键映射为稳定载荷的原生回调。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:55
msgid ""
"The payload format is owned by the plugin; the snapshot only owns "
"registration, ordering and fingerprinting."
msgstr "载荷格式由插件自行决定；快照只负责注册、排序与指纹计算。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:58
msgid "One native hook argument."
msgstr "一个原生钩子参数。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:58
msgid ""
"Python hooks accept arbitrary positional and keyword arguments; the native "
"ABI narrows this to one transformed value plus named scalar keywords."
msgstr "Python 钩子接受任意位置参数与关键字参数；原生 ABI 将其收窄为一个被变换的值加上命名的标量关键字。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:61
msgid "Source group names from the pinned fincore.extensions.discovery module."
msgstr "来自固定版本 fincore.extensions.discovery 模块的源分组名称。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:61
msgid ""
"The native ABI replaces importlib.metadata entry points with explicitly "
"supplied manifests while keeping the same group label."
msgstr "原生 ABI 使用显式提供的清单取代 importlib.metadata 入口点，同时保持相同的分组标签。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:64
msgid "Native equivalent of the pinned Python ExtensionHook value."
msgstr "固定版本 Python ExtensionHook 值的原生等价实现。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:64
msgid ""
"The Python object derives a module:qualname fingerprint from the callback; "
"the native ABI requires that fingerprint explicitly because C++ callables "
"have no portable qualified name."
msgstr "Python 对象从回调派生 module:qualname 指纹；由于 C++ 可调用对象没有可移植的限定名，原生 ABI 要求显式提供该指纹。"

#: ../../site/api/extensions.md:64
msgid ""
"Hooks use priority 100 unless another value is supplied; lower priorities "
"run first."
msgstr "除非另行提供，钩子使用优先级 100；优先级数值越小越先执行。"

